# Config two-layer split (story fmops-07 §4; architecture.md §10).
# DENY-BY-DEFAULT: everything under config/ stays gitignored (secrets and
# per-machine choices never get committed by accident), then the machine-
# agnostic SHARED operating choices are explicitly un-ignored so homes that
# share this setup inherit them. Adding a new SHARED config file means adding
# one `!config/<name>` line here; a new secret needs no change (it is ignored
# by default). NEVER un-ignore a file that can hold a token, password, or a
# per-machine choice.
config/*
!config/worker-playbook.md
!config/firstmate-playbook.md
!config/crew-dispatch.json
!config/backlog-backend
!config/startup-memory-budget
